A cairn white is a walking skeleton, rotted and armed with a longsword. It can keep itself unseen until it strikes. One waited in [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Magical Crimes/People/Detective Ellis Brooks|Detective Brooks]]'s apartment, hidden in the air by the window, and only showed itself when [[People/Anzu|Anzu]] cast over the room and found it.

Its sword was bound to it and vanished when it fell. Wounded, it let out a funereal dirge, and its blows drew the life out of [[People/Benny|Benny]] and left him drained. It frightened those it fought and knocked [[People/Johnny|Johnny]] and Benny down before the Party broke it. It struck out one last time as it died.
